    <string name="timing_notes_body">Widgets cannot update at an exact second forever. Android batches background work, Doze delays alarms, and many phones limit background activity. Short intervals also use more battery. Photo Widget refreshes as close to your interval as Android allows, and a periodic safety check recovers missed updates.</string>
