    <string name="section_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Photo Widget is fully offline. There are no accounts, ads, subscriptions, analytics, telemetry or uploads. It does not request internet access. Photo choices, rendering, settings and history stay in this app’s private storage on your device. Removing a widget deletes its history; uninstalling the app deletes everything.</string>
